 "equipment_type": "Power and energy meter",
 "applies_to": "Accuenergy Acuvim II V3 multifunction power meters with firmware v6.39.",
 "summary": "The Acuvim II V3 meter serves 103 read-only Analog Inputs (real-time values, demand, energy, THD, AXM-IO3 analog inputs and AXM-IO pulse counters) and 44 Binary Inputs (AXM-IO digital inputs and 16 alarm channel status flags). Its object map differs from the AXM-BIP and AXM-WEB2 module lists for the older Acuvim II, for example the pulse counters sit on AI 76-103.",
 "bacnet_transport": [],
 "firmware": "v6.39",
 "default_device_instance": null,
 "access_inferred": false,
 "notes": [
  "AI 72-103 and BI 1-28 carry data only when the matching AXM-IO module is fitted.",
  "AI 33 load type: 82 resistive, 76 inductive, 67 capacitive.",
  "THD objects AI 64-71 are listed with volts / amperes as units in the spreadsheet.",
  "The spreadsheet does not say which BACnet transport the V3 uses.",
  "Source: Accuenergy 'BACnet Points List Acuvim II V3' spreadsheet, firmware v6.39, generated 2026-10-05; alarm channel status BI 29-44 were added 2026-07-17."
 ],
